        "title": "Definition of division",
        "text": "Multiplying by $$\\frac{1}{x}$$ undoes multiplying by $$x$$. Thus multiplying by $$\\frac{1}{x}$$ and $$\\frac{1}{y}$$ undoes multiplying by $$x$$ and $$y$$.",
